{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07896","headline":"夜登孔伯昭南楼时沈太清朱昇在座 · 孟浩然","name":"夜登孔伯昭南楼时沈太清朱昇在座","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁家无风月，此地有琴尊。\n山水会稽郡，诗书孔氏门。\n再来值秋杪，高阁夜无喧。\n华烛罢然蜡，清弦方奏鵾。\n沈生隐侯胤，朱子买臣孙。\n好我意不浅，登兹共话言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}